🟠 db in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps crashing. db went down at 10:01; 5 pods of api and worker were then restarted by their liveness probe (same check as readiness), so the restarts are a symptom. It fails with "FATAL: could not write to file: No space left on device". Service db can't serve traffic. It runs a single replica, so this is downtime, not degradation. api and worker are affected as well. To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs db-4f3043ec-a -c app -n shop --previous
